### 退出登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer 44c45cde-d00d-4f89-b305-4a2e608ef06e

### ① HR 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hr001",
  "password": "demo123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("hr_token", response.body.data);
%}


### ② HR 查询 HR 知识库
# HR 部门对 kb=1 有 WRITE 权限
# 预期：正常返回检索结果
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hr_token}}

{
  "question": "年假怎么申请？",
  "kbIds": [1]
}


### ③ HR 查询技术知识库
# HR 部门对 kb=2 没有权限
# 预期：返回“无权访问该知识库”
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hr_token}}

{
  "question": "代码提交规范",
  "kbIds": [2]
}


### ④ 技术用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tech001",
  "password": "demo123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tech_token", response.body.data);
%}


### ⑤ TECH 查询技术知识库
# TECH 部门对 kb=2 有 WRITE 权限
# 预期：正常返回
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tech_token}}

{
  "question": "Commit Message 格式",
  "kbIds": [2]
}


### ⑥ TECH 查询 HR 知识库
# TECH 部门对 kb=1 有 READ 权限
# 预期：可以正常查询
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tech_token}}

{
  "question": "年假怎么申请？",
  "kbIds": [1]
}


### ⑦ 不带 Token 访问
# 预期：Sa-Token Filter 拦截
# 预期返回：{"code":401,"message":"请先登录"}
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents